          <rules>
            <rule id="41c1-0967-1df3-b058" name="Army General (if no other Army General)" hidden="false">
              <description>If no other Army General is chosen, a Christian Captain may be made Army General (+25 pts); if he does, the army may not include an Imam.</description>
