              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Composite bow, sword. Light Infantry. May form a Combined Formation with Berber Spearmen. Berber Archers must also be made Stubborn (+3 pts per model) if they are in a Combined Unit with Stubborn Berber Spearmen (they cannot be Stubborn on their own). May take a second Musician (African Drummers). (El Cid p.51)</characteristic>
