              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Javelins and hand weapon. May have throwing spear (+2 pts). May have shield (+1 pt). Light Troops (Light Cavalry). Camels cause fear in all cavalry (and chariots). 0-1 unit. May take a second Musician (African Drummers). (El Cid p.51)</characteristic>
