              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Crossbow, sword, light armour. May have shield (+1 pt). Light Infantry. You may not have more units of Mercenary Crossbowmen than units of Mercenary Knights in an army. Aliados y Mercenarios: may have a leader, standard bearer and musician as normal; roll a dice the first time each unit moves, charges or shoots (on a 1 it stays stationary); may not benefit from the Army General or Army Standard Bearer abilities (they may be led by any appropriate character). One Aliados y Mercenarios unit may be personally led by the Army General and is then exempt from these rules. (El Cid p.55)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="4899-7714-26c5-05b5" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
