            <profile id="2534-e68a-b170-c3f0" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="2127-dab1-0af6-7421" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, horse and composite bow. May have shields (+1 pt) or light armour (+2 pts). May have throwing spears (+2 pts). Light Cavalry. Feigned Flight. Parthian Shot (a normal move immediately after shooting, only in the Shooting phase; not a charge reaction; may not march). Expert Horsemen. 0-1 unit. Aliados y Mercenarios: may have a leader, standard bearer and musician as normal; roll a dice the first time each unit moves, charges or shoots (on a 1 it stays stationary); may not benefit from the Army General or Army Standard Bearer abilities (they may be led by any appropriate character). One Aliados y Mercenarios unit may be personally led by the Army General and is then exempt from these rules. (El Cid p.55)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="adc0-bc3f-64fb-bff2" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
